        "product_summary": "Lace-up ankle profile: A raised padded collar and stitched quarter panels create the casual boot outline.\n\nMetal lace guides: Front eyelets continue into metal guides near the tongue top, shown in the actual close-up.\n\nLayered forefoot panels: Curved seams and a wraparound toe edge define the front of the shoe.\n\nPVC outsole: The source identifies the outsole material, and the original underside view shows block and groove sections.\n\nTwo colour options: Black and Brown are listed in EU38-45 for wholesale assortments.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
